452				</ul>
453			</nav>
454		</header>
455		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
456			<section aria-label="Introduction">
457				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
458				<p>
459					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
460					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
461				</p>
462				<p>
463					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
464					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
465				</p>
466			</section>
467	
468			<section aria-labelledby="features">
469				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
470				<ul>
471					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
472					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
473					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
474					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
475					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
476					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
477				</ul>
478			</section>
479	
480			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
481				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
482				<article class="card">
483					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
484					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
485					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
486				</article>
487	
488				<article class="card">
489					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
490					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. All interactive elements include visible focus indicators and proper ARIA labels.</p>
491					<p><strong>Keyboard navigation:</strong> Use <kbd>Tab</kbd> to move forward, <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> to move backward, and <kbd>Enter</kbd> to activate.</p>
492				</article>
493	
494				<article class="card">
495					<h3>Accessible Form</h3>
496					<form id="contact-form" novalidate>
497						<p class="form-hint">Fields marked * are required.</p>
498						<div class="field">
499							<label for="email">Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
500							<input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" required aria-describedby="email-help">
501							<span id="email-error" class="error-message"></span>
502							<small id="email-help" class="form-hint">For example, name@example.com</small>
503						</div>
504						<div class="field">
505							<label for="message">Message</label>
506							<textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="message-help"></textarea>
507							<small id="message-help" class="form-hint">Up to 2,000 characters. <span id="message-count">2,000</span> remaining.</small>
508						</div>
509						<button type="submit">Send message</button>
510						<p id="form-status" role="status"></p>
511					</form>
512				</article>
513	
514				<article class="card">
515					<h3>Live Region Example</h3>
516					<p>Click the button to announce a message using a live region. This demonstrates how screen readers are notified of dynamic updates.</p>
517					<button id="announce" type="button">Announce message</button>
518					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
519						<span id="live-message"></span>
520					</div>
521				</article>
522	
523				<article class="card">
524					<h3>Interactive Counter</h3>
525					<p>This counter demonstrates state management and ARIA live regions for accessible dynamic content.</p>
526					<div class="counter">
527						<button id="decrease" type="button" aria-label="Decrease count by 1">−</button>
528						<output id="count" aria-live="off">0</output>
529						<button id="increase" type="button" aria-label="Increase count by 1">+</button>
530						<button id="reset" type="button" aria-label="Reset count to zero">Reset</button>
531					</div>
532					<div class="live-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
533						<span id="count-message"></span>
534					</div>
535				</article>
536			</section>
